                <mxCell id="3" value="The return type tells us what type of information we will send out, if it was listed as void, the method would send out no information to wherever the method was called from. If it was listed as a double the method must return a value of type double at the end of the method.&amp;nbsp;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
