                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="18" value="everything from left to right from the word &quot;returnType&quot; to the end of &quot;Parameters&quot; is known as the method signature and is all of the information related to what a method will do or require without having looked at the instructions&amp;nbsp;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
